WEBVTT

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:15.360
Yuu...

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.450
Where's Haruka?
Tell me where Haruka is?

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.340
Where is she?! What happened to her?!

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:29.710
Where did she go?!

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.510
Yuu, calm down!

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.010
You!

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.180
You saved yourself
instead of her, didn't you?

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.830
They disappeared.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.420
Hey, what the hell happened?!

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.750
The erosion of Shangri-la
is getting worse.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:39.470
If this goes on, a violation of causation
could occur in this dimension as well.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:40.470
What?

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.140
Actually, it might have already started.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.140
A violation of causation?

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:50.980
Come on, what are you talking about?
Explain it so I can understand!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.070
It means that the cause
and effect become reversed.

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:58.110
Cause and effect become reversed?

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:01.160
The past will become
influenced by the future.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:07.410
The past can be influenced by
the future? Is that possible?

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:29.890
Karasu!

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.810
You should forget about him.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:36.190
To you, he is only an illusion.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.780
Karasu isn't an illusion!

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:42.110
Then go find out for yourself...

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.240
Haruka.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.840
Karasu was always there for me.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.220
I'm going out for a second!

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:12.180
What do you intend to do
with the Dragon Torque?

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.040
Help me...

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.540
Am I gonna die?

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:45.300
Karasu is Yuu 15 years
in the future, right?

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.900
You found it.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.360
Karasu!

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.200
Haruka...

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.200
Karasu...

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.750
Haruka...

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.080
This is...

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.870
Huh? It's already 7:30!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.080
Oh, no. I over slept.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.920
Another me?

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:22.110
Mom, breakfast is ready, okay?

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:24.610
Haruka, what time is it?

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.860
It's past 8 o'clock.
I have to go to school now.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.240
See you later!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.320
Have fun.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.950
Think I'll sleep a little longer.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.250
Today is the last day of first term.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.300
That's a homeless spirit!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.340
If you talk to it, you'll get
dragged into the spirit world!

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:52.930
Morning, Ai!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.510
Hi, Haruka.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.100
Looks like they're having fun.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:59.890
Miho's having a lecture
on spiritual phenomenon.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:00.940
Ah, I see.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:05.190
Good morning, everyone! The bell
is about to ring! Take your seats!

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:08.650
I'll take summer break
consultations after homeroom.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:09.900
Miss Yukie!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.530
Yes, Fujiwara?

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:13.910
Let's go on a date on summer break!

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:17.540
I'm so sorry. My date planner is
all booked up for the next 3 years.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.870
That's impossible.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.380
I think it's slightly different.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:36.260
Okay, it's settled. You're coming
with us for fright night, Fujiwara!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.850
B-But why?!

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:42.310
I don't wanna go to no fright night! Right, Yuu?

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:45.730
- Yeah. I have cram school so I can't go.
- Yuu...

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.650
Fujiwara, make sure you show up!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:51.650
Could it be that you're a scared cat?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:55.240
Maybe you're too scared and embarrassed
that you'll pee in your pants?

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.240
Wh-What did you say, Mukai?!

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.410
A-ha, I'm right then!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:00.830
Are not!

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.750
Yuu, hold up one minute!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.710
Hey, you're acting weird.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.260
You've forgotten, haven't you.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.420
Huh? Uh...

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:16.100
Geez, Yuu hasn't been
much of a friend recently.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.680
Can't help it.
Goto's got middle school exams.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:27.060
So, I remember at that time,
but it feels slightly different.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:46.880
Nice ship, huh? It cost
a cool 25 billion yen.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:51.260
It's not a passenger ship, so it
isn't that comfortable of a ride, but...

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.970
Shinohara...

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.430
Just take your time.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:59.600
I bet in reality
you're dying to see it too.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.350
The deal was for you to
call off the experiment.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.270
What? Was it?

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:09.190
I somehow doubt I actually
said I would call it off.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:10.940
Why, you...

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:14.950
Besides, you accepted
the money, didn't you?

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.910
That was supposed to be
an official compensation.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.910
But you know, I paid you
good money for your services...

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:25.710
so I'd appreciate a little after care.
All my guys are full of hot air.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:30.170
The other day, they failed
three times at the Tsukuba laboratory.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.920
Naturally, I fired
five of 'em on the spot.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:38.680
It no longer concerns me.
If you'll excuse me...

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.930
I'll do it the way it stands, you know.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.640
But the theta particles
will leak out as it stands!

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.150
I guess so. Oh, well.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:52.730
I'll be watching the experiment
from Tokyo, so what do I care?

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:56.450
Do you want to disintegrate
this entire region?!

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:02.120
Come to think of it, isn't your
daughter living in this area too?

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:06.410
Come on, professor.
Let's watch it go down together.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:11.340
Let's see this world that
transcends time and space.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:23.220
Uh-oh, I dozed off.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.390
Look at the time!

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:31.150
That's right. I went to Yuu's cram school.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.110
Why are you waiting for me
in front of cram school?

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:40.660
'Cause I was bored.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:45.370
If you walk around at this time
of night, you'll be taken into custody.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:49.870
If you're so worried about that
then don't run away from home.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.960
You're the one who suggested it!

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.460
Because you wanted to go
to your dad's place in Tokyo.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.470
I was having a fight
with Mom when I said that.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:03.850
My parents are divorced,
so it gets tricky sometimes.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.350
I was a fool to take you seriously.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:07.470
Yuu?!

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:08.980
Forget it.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:11.350
Come on, Yuu. Don't be mad.

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:18.320
Even if I did run away, I'd be
found right away and taken back.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:21.110
Kids can't do anything on their own.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:25.370
Even I know that.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:29.080
That isn't true.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.960
When you grow up, you'll be
able to go anywhere you want.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.960
How come I'm not a grown up?

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.050
Yuu?

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:38.800
I hate being a child.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:41.880
I want to grow up as
quickly as possible, and...

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:45.680
Yuu...

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:49.850
I think I'm losing it.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.900
Yuu?

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:54.440
Stay back!

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.020
Ou...

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:59.740
Really! You didn't have to shove me!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.150
I... I'm sorry.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.320
It's different from before.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.660
Where's Karasu?

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:13.080
Yuu, let's run away tomorrow.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:13.960
Huh?

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:16.130
The me that's here...

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.090
Are you serious?

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:24.300
We made a deal to run away together.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.890
Let's head out tomorrow morning.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.180
Where will we go?

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:31.350
Tokyo. Let's go to my dad's place.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:33.690
Huh?

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.560
What is it?

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:37.730
You know what?

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.270
Huh?

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.280
I think I'm forgetting...

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:45.160
...something important.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.990
Who is that person?

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.830
I've forgotten.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:52.750
You will forget...

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.710
Did you get in touch with your dad?

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:01.380
Or did he say something
about you running away?

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.800
I guess I ran away from home.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:10.760
Is that the dimension you want?

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:16.560
Is that the dimension you chose?

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:19.770
Do you really want
to settle for that one?

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:23.280
That I chose? What do you mean?

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:32.490
Karasu came from the future...

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.210
but I'm sure he's the other Yuu.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.760
He always protects me.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.980
Die!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:16.620
Fukuro!

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:20.380
But someday Karasu will
disappear from my sight.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.880
After all, there can only be one Yuu.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:33.430
Was I saved by Haruka once again?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.520
It's just like before.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:46.740
I was supposed to die in that battle.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.370
Don't let it reach ground!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:14:59.830
Where is Karasu?!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.250
Go around to the left!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.380
Not again! It has a shield!

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:42.920
Karasu has jumped on!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.990
It's no good! It's collapsing!
Run for it, Karasu!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.950
Karasu!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.050
When I passed through
the dimensional ravine...

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.800
I arrived in this dimension.

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:40.520
But at the time,
I didn't realize the fact...

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:44.850
...that I had been transported
to another near by dimension.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:51.110
My life was saved by
being drawn into this dimension.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:56.950
But because I transported here...

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:59.450
La'cryma learned about this dimension.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:02.750
And learned about the existence of Haruka.

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:08.790
And I may have also
drawn in one other dimension.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.880
They're after Haruka?

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:16.840
Haruka?!

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:20.350
Where am I?

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.020
They're here, they're here,
I can feel their presence!

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.440
Cut it out, Mukai!
You're creeping me out!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.900
What are you talking about?!
We're going to meet a ghost!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.360
Be a little more serious
about it, Fujiwara!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.150
Serious? How can I be serious?

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:35.700
Sense them! Chant from
the bottom of your heart!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:40.030
- Mr. Ghost, Mr. Ghost, please come out!
- She's impossible...

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:42.040
Worried about Goto?

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:48.790
There's nothing you can do about it.
His folks won't allow it.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:49.580
That's true.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.550
Cheer up, Haruka!

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:52.340
Yeah.

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:55.170
C'mon, let's go!
We'll get left behind.

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.510
Hey, Ai?

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:01.600
I have this feeling I'm
forgetting something important.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:03.470
Haruka...

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:05.850
Let's go home already.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:09.440
No! I'm not going home
until I see a ghost!

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:11.980
Aw, come on!

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:14.400
Ai, something's different.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:15.400
Huh?

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:16.570
It's different!

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:19.700
You're right! There's no such thing
as a graveyard without ghosts!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.160
It's coming this way!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:31.330
A bird?

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:32.250
We have to run...

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.340
What's wrong?!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:35.300
Hurry, guys! Hurry!

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:38.800
Something's flying toward us!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.180
Impossible!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.430
Everybody run for it! Hurry!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.520
I found you.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:49.560
This is impossible!

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.440
It's a ghost! It's a land-bound spirit!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:53.360
What's going on?!

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:58.450
He's after me. Okay!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.240
- You guys go that way!
- Haruka?!

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.840
I finally found you, Haruka.

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:16.840
Stay back!

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:22.430
So, you assimilated with
yourself of this dimension.

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:28.930
It's all right now.
Now, come. Let's go home.

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:31.770
Who are you?

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:37.570
Oh, Haruka.
Have you forgotten me?

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:43.950
But if you come to Shangri-la,
you will remember.

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:49.450
Now come with me to Shangri-la...

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:51.670
Haruka!

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.250
Yuu...

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.430
Who are you?!

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.140
Who, me?

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:13.100
Do you want to know?

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:15.560
Who are you?

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:18.820
Do you want to know?

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:20.780
Who are you?!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.030
So, you want to know...

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.860
Well, who are you?!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.950
I...

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.950
...am you.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:41.590
Haruka, run!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.090
Haruka!

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:46.220
This isn't where I was...

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.720
I...

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:52.230
I had forgotten something important.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:59.610
I remember. This is where I met Karasu.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:12.660
But it wasn't the first time.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:16.210
I met him once before.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:21.840
It was almost Spring but
it was snowing that day...

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:23.510
at that church.

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:05.920
What is this? Is the
dimension becoming warped!

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:14.220
What the?

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:18.980
Haruka!

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:24.860
Yuu...

00:22:25.360 --> 00:22:28.070
Are you okay, Haruka?
Are you hurt?

00:22:28.110 --> 00:22:32.200
Yuu... You came to save me again.

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.500
Thanks, Yuu.

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:41.250
It... It's no big deal.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:45.460
He was worried about you, too.

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:47.090
He?

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:01.480
Karasu.

00:24:42.290 --> 00:24:44.580
I'm dreaming again.

00:24:45.250 --> 00:24:47.090
That summer day's dream.

00:24:48.590 --> 00:24:51.380
It doesn't matter even if I disappear.

00:24:54.220 --> 00:24:56.390
Please don't fight with Karasu.

00:25:01.100 --> 00:25:03.390
Then fight me, Karasu!

00:25:04.020 --> 00:25:07.020
Next episode, Dilemma.

00:25:07.060 --> 00:25:09.860
Can you look within yourself?
